 "title_en": "Anthropic IPO: the hot-potato game has already started | Don't be fooled by +17% — why KOSPI and gold fell together",
 "description_head": "앤트로픽 상장 +17%, 그 숫자 뒤에서 시초가에 산 개인은 30분 만에 -13%. 같은 날 다우·나스닥, 오늘 아침 코스피 5000선과 금값까지 같이 밀렸습니다.\n앤트로픽 주가 전망 · 시장 전체를 때린 세 가지 충격, 역사가 보여 준 결말, 지금 확인할 신호 세 개.",
 "description_en": "Anthropic (ANT) opened at $111.50 on day one, 34% above its $83 IPO price, fell about 13% within 30 minutes (roughly $200B in market value), touched $92.72 and closed at $97.17 (+17%) while the Nasdaq-100 fell 2.2%. Time bomb or momentum? We weigh three arguments on each side — the first 30 minutes, a valuation of ~26x annualized Q3 sales, Korean retail locked out of the offering and the SpaceX precedent vs. $17B Q3 revenue, the reported Dec 21 Nasdaq-100 entry and compute spending flowing to memory makers — and judge by the dates that matter: index inclusion, first earnings and lock-up expiries. Not investment advice.",
